{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Avenger</strong> is a dynamic top-down shooter where you take on the role of an elite agent sent on a solo mission to eliminate a terrorist organization that has acquired cutting-edge teleportation technology. Use a deadly arsenal, fight your way through waves of dangerous enemies, and stop the threat before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/0c5846159af12bc40a1630e1cac4a98f.poster.avif?t=1757268783\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/0c5846159af12bc40a1630e1cac4a98f.webm?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/0c5846159af12bc40a1630e1cac4a98f.mp4?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, a terrorist group raids a research facility and steals revolutionary technology \u2014 a portal network that allows instant travel between any point on Earth. This invention makes the organization extremely mobile and dangerous. When the government manages to locate one of their bases, it decides to strike immediately. Due to the classified nature of the operation, only a single operative \u2014 a professional special agent \u2014 is sent in. His mission: infiltrate enemy bases through the same portal network and eliminate them one by one before the world plunges into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/c467a074567028ed530be6e5109c8265.poster.avif?t=1757268783\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/c467a074567028ed530be6e5109c8265.webm?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/c467a074567028ed530be6e5109c8265.mp4?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles in <i>Cyber Avenger</i> unfold in a fast-paced top-down shooter format, where you\u2019ll need to keep moving, dodging, and making split-second decisions. Players have access to a variety of weapons: a pistol for precision shooting, an assault rifle for rapid engagements, a shotgun with devastating close-range power, a sniper rifle for long-range eliminations, and a grenade launcher for dealing with heavily armored targets. Enemy types are just as varied \u2014 from melee fighters and suicide bombers to foes with automatic weapons, mortar crews, and even mechs equipped with heavy machine guns. Each enemy requires a different strategy and the right choice of weapon. Intense firefights and constant motion make every encounter tense and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/a05a0eb30f683133bb30da2fc5035966.poster.avif?t=1757268783\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/a05a0eb30f683133bb30da2fc5035966.webm?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/a05a0eb30f683133bb30da2fc5035966.mp4?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features six unique levels, each with its own visual style and gameplay elements. As you progress, you'll unlock new weapons, face increasingly challenging enemies, and delve deeper into the story. The game\u2019s pacing steadily increases, pushing you to adapt to new threats and master every skill necessary for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/ddbee20faabce54f6c8dcc837e0d9f79.poster.avif?t=1757268783\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/ddbee20faabce54f6c8dcc837e0d9f79.webm?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/extras/ddbee20faabce54f6c8dcc837e0d9f79.mp4?t=1757268783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of weapons with distinct stats and tactical uses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemy types that require different strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 uniquely designed levels with varying atmospheres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging storyline with elements of science fiction</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LEVEL_1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2606270/47ca3b5ae57a00723449bdadc3bafd90ad0a2881.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2606270?t=1757268783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606270/4b8